Spectra modifies the following upstream core files to enforce a durable
single-attempt order execution contract and retain attributable execution
evidence. Each modified file includes a prominent change notice.

  hummingbot/strategy_v2/executors/order_executor/order_executor.py
  hummingbot/connector/exchange/kraken/kraken_exchange.py
  hummingbot/core/web_assistant/connections/rest_connection.py
  hummingbot/connector/client_order_tracker.py

Spectra adds the following execution journal and guard module:

  hummingbot/strategy_v2/executors/order_executor/spectra_attempt_guard.py

The build recipe also provides an overlay verifier and guarded API startup
entrypoint. The supplied overlay manifest identifies the exact modified
source files and their hashes; the image labels identify the upstream pins
and overlay identity. These notices do not assert that an image has been
built, installed, deployed, or used for live trading.
